{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a remote countryside of Brazil, Arthur and his friends\u2013Angela, Junior, and Lucia\u2013have their return to school interrupted by a <strong>Delusion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delusion occurs when a place becomes corrupted by an energy called <strong>SIN</strong>, turning animals hostile and distorting reality based on traumas and nightmares. To survive the Disillusion, Arthur and his friends rely on the power of Hope, an energy known as <strong>FAITH</strong>, and their imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a linear gameplay flow focused on dialogue and exploration, you must solve puzzles and face enemies in <strong>turn-based combat</strong> within the corrupted school. The more enemies you fight, the stronger you become by accumulating <strong>FAITH</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is inspired by horror games made in RPG Maker and adapted into a 3D perspective, with strong influences from retro PSX-style graphics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A <strong>sinister</strong> and <strong>distorted</strong> atmosphere;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>4 playable characters</strong>, each with unique stories and mechanics;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Turn</strong>-<strong>based</strong> <strong>combat</strong> featuring unique <strong>SIN</strong> and <strong>FAITH</strong> systems;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Nostalgic visuals</strong> with original, <strong>hand-painted</strong> digital textures;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- An <strong>original</strong> and <strong>distorted</strong> <strong>soundtrack.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560420?t=1745251229","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560420/a8d65f98a863cccc0bc1850ef17d08bf49a5a76e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745251229","capsule_image":"ht